# flow-lifecycle
flow deploy adt
flow start adt
flow pause adt
flow resume adt
flow halt adt
flow resume adt
flow stop adt
flow start adt
flow pause nope
flow stop-destination adt out
flow start-destination adt out
flow start-destination adt nope
